Package: synpdx
Title: NLME-Based Interaction Analysis for PDX Combination Studies
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Junho",
    family = "Yoon",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mothquitoman@gmail.com"
  )
Description: Fits nonlinear mixed-effects tumor-growth and drug-effect models with
    SAEM, computes manuscript-consistent interaction distances, and provides
    chi-square and cluster-bootstrap inference for PDX combination studies.
